description: Laundry App Product Overview
alwaysApply: true
---

## Purpose

- Provide an on-demand laundry service platform connecting customers with laundry service providers (marts) and delivery partners.
- Eliminate the inefficiencies of traditional laundry services with digital ordering, tracking, and payment systems.
- Enable multi-tenant operation supporting multiple laundry marts with independent operations and branding.
- Support flexible pricing models (per-piece and per-kg) with real-time tracking and proof-of-service delivery.

## Problems Addressed

- Avoid manual order taking and tracking in laundry services
- Reduce customer wait times with scheduled pickup and delivery
- Bridge communication gaps between customers, laundry marts, and delivery partners
- Enable transparent pricing and real-time order tracking
- Provide proof of pickup and delivery with photo verification
- Simplify payment processing with multiple payment methods
- Enable data-driven business insights through analytics and reporting

## Core Modules

### User Management (6 User Types)
1. **Admin (Mart Owner)**
   - Monitor all operations and analytics
   - Create and manage Collection Managers
   - Create and manage Distribution Managers
   - Create and manage Service Men
   - Approve Delivery Partner verification
   - Configure mart settings and pricing
   - Generate reports and analytics

2. **Customer**
   - Registration and authentication with OTP verification
   - Profile management (name, email, phone, saved addresses)
   - Multiple address management with geolocation
   - Cart management with service selection
   - Place orders with dual pricing model (per-piece and per-kg)
   - Real-time order tracking with detailed status
   - Order history and filtering
   - Feedback and rating system

3. **Delivery Partner**
   - Self-registration with email authentication
   - Profile setup with vehicle and document details
   - Admin verification required before activation
   - Real-time pickup and drop requests
   - Accept/decline delivery assignments
   - Weight machine indicator (for per-kg orders)
   - Photo proof capture for pickups and deliveries
   - Payment confirmation on delivery
   - Earnings and delivery history tracking

4. **Collection Manager**
   - Email-based login with OTP verification
   - Created by Admin
   - Manage three order stages:
     * **Incoming Orders**: Newly placed orders awaiting pickup
     * **Orders Received**: Orders picked up and delivered to collection center
     * **Orders Submitted**: Orders assigned to service men
   - Auto-assign delivery partners (2-minute window)
   - Manual delivery partner assignment fallback
   - Mark orders as received after pickup
   - Assign orders to service men (auto-distributed to service queues)
   - Track order progress

5. **Service Man**
   - One service man per service (1:1 relationship)
   - Email-based login with OTP verification
   - Created by Admin with service assignment
   - Manage service-specific item queue (FIFO)
   - View pending items by order
   - Mark items/orders as "in progress" or "completed"
   - Add comments on item status
   - Track completion history

6. **Distribution Manager**
   - Email-based login with OTP verification
   - Created by Admin
   - Manage three views:
     * **Services Completed**: Individual services marked complete
     * **Orders Completed**: Orders with all services finished, ready for dispatch
     * **Orders Dispatched**: Orders sent out for delivery
   - Assign delivery partners for final delivery
   - Dispatch orders to customers
   - Track delivery status

### Cart Management
- Service category browsing
- Service selection within categories
- Pricing type selection (per-piece or per-kg)
- Item selection with quantity for per-piece
- Weight entry for per-kg items
- Multi-service cart support
- Cart persistence across sessions
- Checkout with address and scheduling

### Service Catalog
- Service category management (Regular Wash, Pro Clean, Luxury Care, Home Linens)
- Individual service definitions with pricing and duration estimates
- Clothing item catalog with per-piece pricing
- Per-kg pricing for bulk items
- Service-specific item lists
- Service man assignment (one per service)
- Service icons and imagery
- Active/inactive service management
- Display order configuration for UI

### Order Management (New Workflow)
**Order Lifecycle:**
1. **Placed**: Customer places order from cart
2. **Pickup Assigned**: Delivery partner auto-assigned (2-min window) or manually assigned
3. **Picked Up**: Delivery partner picks up from customer (with photo proof)
4. **Received by Collection**: Collection Manager receives and marks order
5. **Submitted to Services**: Order items distributed to service queues (FIFO)
6. **Services in Progress**: Service men working on items
7. **Services Completed**: All items processed
8. **Dispatch Assigned**: Distribution Manager assigns delivery partner
9. **Out for Delivery**: Order being delivered to customer
10. **Payment Pending**: Delivered, awaiting payment confirmation
11. **Delivered**: Payment confirmed by delivery partner
12. **Closed**: Order completed

**Features:**
- Dual pricing model support (per-piece and per-kg)
- Cart-based order creation
- Pickup and delivery scheduling
- Auto-assignment with fallback to manual
- Weight machine requirement indicator
- Item-level status tracking
- Service queue management (FIFO)
- Real-time status updates and notifications
- Photo proof for pickup and delivery
- Payment confirmation on delivery

### Service Queue Management (FIFO)
- Automatic item distribution to service-specific queues
- FIFO (First In, First Out) ordering
- Order-based item grouping
- Item status tracking (pending, in_progress, completed)
- Service man assignment
- Priority management
- Completion timestamps
- Comments and notes

### Billing & Payments
- Invoice generation with item-wise breakdown
- Delivery fee calculation based on distance
- Tax and discount application
- Multiple payment methods (Card, COD, UPI, Wallet)
- Payment status tracking (pending, completed, failed, refunded)
- Payment confirmation by delivery partner on delivery
- Transaction ID tracking
- Digital receipts

### Delivery Management
- Delivery partner self-registration
- Admin verification and approval required
- Document verification (license, vehicle, ID proof)
- Real-time pickup and drop requests
- Accept/decline functionality
- Route navigation and distance calculation
- Weight machine indicator for per-kg orders
- Pickup proof with photo (mandatory)
- Delivery proof with photo (mandatory)
- Payment confirmation on delivery
- Delivery duration tracking (estimated vs actual)
- Partner availability status management
- Delivery ratings and feedback

### Analytics & Reporting
- Daily mart metrics (orders, revenue, cancellations)
- Customer spending patterns and retention
- Service popularity analysis
- Service man performance (items completed, avg time)
- Delivery performance metrics
- Collection and distribution efficiency
- Revenue trends and forecasting
- Customer acquisition and engagement
- Staff performance tracking by role

## Architectural Principles

- Multi-tenant architecture supporting independent laundry mart operations
- Separate mobile applications for customers and delivery partners
- Admin web panel for mart management
- Real-time tracking and notifications
- Geolocation-based service radius and delivery fee calculation
- Photo proof verification for pickups and deliveries
- Flexible pricing models supporting different business needs
- Scalable REST API architecture with PostgreSQL database
- Cloud storage (S3) for images and documents
- Docker containerization for consistent deployment

